Coordinate daily shipments by assisting with driver route planning; 
Dispatch drivers and make sure they have the information needed to complete deliveries on time; 
Communicate with drivers during the shift to provide updates, clarify details, and resolve operational issues; 
Maintain transportation-related documentation and keep shipment information accurate and up to date; 
Collaborate with the Operations team.
Requirements 
1+ years of experience in US-based transportation company as Support Representative, Tracking Assistant or Dispatcher positions; 
Excellent verbal and written English skills; 
Proficient Computer skills (Microsoft Office, especially Excel); 
Extreme focus on organization and time management; 
Attention to details and multitasking skills. 
What we offer: 
Fixed salary paid in USD with taxes covered; 
Clear career growth pass — we’re filling 50% of middle/senior positions by promoting existing employees; 
Health insurance after 6 months with the company; 
Regular company events and team buildings to connect, recharge, and have a great time. 
Work conditions:
Office work in Kyiv or remote;
Night Shifts Schedule: (11 PM — 8 AM) 5 working days/2 days off
If you are looking for a place to start your career in logistics and get opportunities to grow, we are waiting for you!

